WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.615 --> 00:00:13.443
Everything lives on your device, so keep a backup. Today reminds you every week.

2
00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:20.456
Press Back up now. One file holds your lessons, classes, pupils, PBD and settings.

3
00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:25.409
Save it to Google Drive, WhatsApp it to yourself, or keep it on your laptop.

4
00:00:25.409 --> 00:00:32.569
Now imagine the lesson was lost.

5
00:00:32.569 --> 00:00:40.473
On any device, open Me, Backup, Restore from a file and choose the backup.

6
00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:49.658
Add to what is here keeps this device's work. Replace everything makes it match the backup.

7
00:00:49.658 --> 00:00:55.602
The lesson is back. Textbook PDFs are not in backups, so add them again on a new phone.

8
00:00:55.602 --> 00:00:58.903
That's all. Find more in the manual under Me, Help.
